OL,3,GNEWSATravel disruption as water mains
OL,4,Abursts in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad closures and public transport
OL,7,Fdiversion are in place across
OL,8,FManchester city centre after a mains
OL,9,Fwater pipe burst.
OL,11,FPortland Street and Piccadilly Gardens
OL,12,Fbus station have been closed off after
OL,13,Fthe water main burst earlier on
OL,14,FPortland Street.
OL,16,FThe closures will be in place until
OL,17,Ffurther notice and Bee Network buses
OL,18,Fhave been diverted while utility
OL,19,Fcompanies carry out repair works,
OL,20,FTransport for Greater Manchester (TfGM)
OL,21,Fconfirmed.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
